00:033:42.000 --> 00:033:49.000
means my Lord, I respond to Your call, Labbayka Lā Shareeka Laka Labbayk

00:033:49.000 --> 00:033:53.000
I respond to you. There is no partner with You.

00:033:53.000 --> 00:034:01.000
And the whole statement will be taught to you by the Mutawwif.

00:034:01.000 --> 00:034:07.000
The main statement that you need to know throughout Hajj goes like this

00:034:07.000 --> 00:034:13.000
Labbayka Allāhumma Labbyak which means my Lord, I respond to Your call.

00:034:13.000 --> 00:034:23.000
Labbayka Lā Shareeka Laka Labbayk, I respond to You. You have no partner. There is no partner with You, I respond to Your call.

00:034:23.000 --> 00:034:28.000
And this is what it looks like. Here's the first word Labbayka

00:034:28.000 --> 00:034:34.000
which means I respond to You. I respond to Your call. Labbayka.

00:034:34.000 --> 00:034:41.000
Allāhumma which means my God or our God, Allāhumma.

00:034:41.000 --> 00:034:46.000
Labbayka Allāhumma Labbayk.

00:034:46.000 --> 00:034:50.000
Labbayka, I respond to Your call.

00:034:50.000 --> 00:035:00.000
Lā means no. Shareeka means partner or idol. Lā Shareeka Laka, with You Labbayk,

00:035:00.000 --> 00:035:04.000
I respond to a call.

00:035:04.000 --> 00:035:13.000
Labbayka Allāhumma Labbyak Labbayka Lā Shareeka Laka Labbayk.

00:035:13.000 --> 00:035:18.000
This is all you need. And you utter this statement. You

00:035:18.000 --> 00:035:23.000
memorize it, and utter it all the time during Hajj, throughout Hajj, any time

00:035:23.000 --> 00:035:27.000
you change direction, you climb a hill, down a hill, you meet friends, you say that.

00:035:27.000 --> 00:035:32.000
Labbayka Allāhumma Labbyak Labbayka Lā Shareeka Laka Labbayk.

00:035:32.000 --> 00:035:37.000
The details of the Hajj will be given to you by the guide that will be assigned to

00:035:37.000 --> 00:035:40.000
you as soon as you arrive in Saudi Arabia.

